# UI and accessibility

- Prefer semantic HTML (`table`, `nav`, `button`) over div soup.
- Status must not rely on colour alone — include text labels.
- shadcn on Base UI uses `render`, not Radix `asChild`.
- Keyboard-operable controls; focus visible; live regions for async feedback.

Reference: `docs/17-ui-design-guidelines.md`, `docs/08-ui-states-and-accessibility.md`
